    axis bucket, and may ADD an extra domain if clinically required). Do NOT
    drop a mandatory domain.
  - candidate_entities_by_domain : SPECIFIC diseases that live UNDER each
    domain. These are for sub-branch refinement (L2/L3) ONLY — NEVER use a
    specific entity as an L1 label. Keep L1 labels at the domain/family
    granularity named in mandatory_coverage.
Set each branch's classification_axis to l1_classification_axis. This frame
is ADDITIVE: keep the normal JSON schema; just ensure coverage + single axis.
